# HeeraHisaab — Full Project Brief for Building 2 Pages

> **Goal:** Build two standalone pages for the developer's portfolio site:
> 1. **Privacy Policy** page
> 2. **Product Details & User Guide** page
>
> Both pages should link back to the live app: **https://heerahisaab.web.app**

