## 6. Visual Design Notes

Both pages should match the **premium, modern aesthetic** of the HeeraHisaab app:

- **Font:** [Outfit](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Outfit) (Google Fonts) — weights 300–700
- **Color Palette:**
  - Primary: `#3b82f6` (blue)
  - Primary Gradient: `linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #2563eb 100%)`
  - Secondary/Success: `#10b981` (green)
  - Danger: `#ef4444` (red)
  - Dark background: `#0f172a`
  - Surface: `#1e293b`
  - Text primary (dark mode): `#f1f5f9`
  - Text secondary: `#94a3b8`
- **UI Style:** Glassmorphism (frosted glass cards, subtle blur, soft shadows)
- **Theme color (meta):** `#0f172a`

