## 7. Page Structure Suggestions

### Page 1: Privacy Policy
Standard sections:
1. Introduction (what HeeraHisaab is + effective date)
2. Information We Collect (§5.3 above)
3. How We Use Your Information
4. Data Storage & Security (§5.2, §5.7)
5. Third-Party Services (§5.6)
6. Data Retention & Deletion (§5.5)
7. Children's Privacy (§5.8)
8. Changes to This Policy (§5.9)
9. Contact Us (§5.10)

### Page 2: Product Details & User Guide
Sections:
1. Hero — App name, tagline, screenshot/mockup, CTA to open the app
2. What is HeeraHisaab? — 2–3 sentence overview
3. Key Features — Cards or grid for each feature (§4.1–4.7)
4. How to Use — Step-by-step guide (Login → Add Defaults → Log Entry → View History → Dashboard)
5. Supported Languages — English & Gujarati
6. Install on Your Phone — PWA installation instructions (Add to Home Screen)
7. FAQ (optional)
8. Footer with links to Privacy Policy, live app, developer portfolio

